### Non-Unit Step Increments

Loops can update counters by arbitrary steps:
```java
// Step by 3:
int i = 1;
while (i < 10) {
    System.out.print(i + " "); // Prints: 1 4 7
    i += 3;
}
// i becomes 10, loop exits.
```

#### Multiplication Step (Logarithmic Loops):
```java
int p = 1;
while (p <= 16) {
    System.out.print(p + " "); // Prints: 1 2 4 8 16
    p *= 2; // Doubles each step: O(log N) iterations!
}
```

