### Printing Geometric Patterns

Right-angled triangle pattern of asterisks:
```java
int n = 4;
int row = 1;

while (row <= n) {
    int col = 1;
    while (col <= row) {
        System.out.print("*");
        col++;
    }
    System.out.println(); // Move to next line
    row++;
}
```

#### Output:
```
*
**
***
****
```
- In row 1: inner loop runs 1 time (`col <= 1`).
- In row 2: inner loop runs 2 times (`col <= 2`).
- In row `r`: inner loop runs `r` times.

