### Generating Mathematical Sequences

#### Fibonacci Sequence Generation:
```java
int n = 6; // Generate first 6 terms
int a = 0, b = 1;
int count = 1;

while (count <= n) {
    System.out.print(a + " ");
    int next = a + b;
    a = b;
    b = next;
    count++;
}
// Outputs: 0 1 1 2 3 5
```

